{"id":"8a46f83845d36b9e","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-autocomplex-dnc.md","title":"自复杂性恰好刻画DNC计算能力","display":"thm-autocomplex-dnc — 自复杂性恰好刻画DNC计算能力","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-autocomplex-dnc","aliases":["43-thm-autocomplex-dnc"],"display":"thm-autocomplex-dnc — 自复杂性恰好刻画DNC计算能力","depends_on":["[[43-df-order-complexity]]","[[43-df-dnc]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Lemma 11.11.4 (Kjos-Hanssen–Merkle–Stephan)","source_printed_pages":"275–276","source_pdf_pages":"295–296","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-autocomplex-dnc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-autocomplex-dnc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-autocomplex-dnc — 自复杂性恰好刻画DNC计算能力"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bcb978a14a477f5c\" href=\"?note=bcb978a14a477f5c\" title=\"43-df-order-complexity\">43-df-order-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"323b0a74dc337ecf\" href=\"?note=323b0a74dc337ecf\" title=\"43-df-dnc\">43-df-dnc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 11.11.4 (Kjos-Hanssen–Merkle–Stephan)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"275–276"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"295–296"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Autocomplex}\">\\(\\operatorname{Autocomplex}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DNC}\">\\(\\operatorname{DNC}\\)</span>、函数归约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bcb978a14a477f5c\" href=\"?note=bcb978a14a477f5c\" title=\"43-df-order-complexity\">43-df-order-complexity</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"323b0a74dc337ecf\" href=\"?note=323b0a74dc337ecf\" title=\"43-df-dnc\">43-df-dnc</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)\\iff\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(f\\le_TX\\land\\operatorname{DNC}(f)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)\\iff\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(f\\le_TX\\land\\operatorname{DNC}(f)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>DNC约束只在对角计算收敛时施加。源证明利用高复杂度输出与对角输出的低复杂度比较；逆向用DNC计算的有限使用界编码初段。核对了两方向的陈述与变量对应，未独立重证整段编码。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Lemma 11.11.4 (Kjos-Hanssen–Merkle–Stephan)；印刷页275–276，PDF页295–296。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-order-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"bcb978a14a477f5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-order-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"323b0a74dc337ecf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dnc]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-order-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"bcb978a14a477f5c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Autocomplex}$、$\\operatorname{DNC}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-order-complexity]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"323b0a74dc337ecf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Autocomplex}$、$\\operatorname{DNC}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-order-complexity]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Autocomplex}$、$\\operatorname{DNC}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-order-complexity]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Autocomplex}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DNC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)\\iff\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(f\\le_TX\\land\\operatorname{DNC}(f)).","display":true}],"bytes":1569,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-286","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-autocomplex-dnc]] — 自复杂性恰好刻画DNC计算能力"}],"outgoing":["bcb978a14a477f5c","323b0a74dc337ecf","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}